---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import Button from "../../components/ui/Button.astro";
import Callout from "../../components/ui/Callout.astro";
import Card from "../../components/ui/Card.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../../components/ui/Eyebrow.astro";
import Section from "../../components/ui/Section.astro";
import Signature from "../../components/ui/Signature.astro";
import Stitch from "../../components/ui/Stitch.astro";
---

<Page
	title="Organize: pass the ordinance where you live"
	description="One clause: automated decisions by your city require a named human reviewer who can be appealed to and answers by name. The model ordinance, the two-minute council script, and where it is already working."
>
	<section class="ae-pillar-hero" aria-labelledby="organize-title">
		<Eyebrow tone="coral">Pillar 01 · A demand</Eyebrow>
		<h1 id="organize-title" class="ae-pillar-h1">
			Pass the ordinance <span class="ae-pillar-h1-accent">where you live.</span>
		</h1>
		<p class="ae-hero-sub ae-pillar-lede">
			Cities decided to install the cameras. Cities can decide a person reviews
			what they trigger. The ask is one clause: automated decisions by the city
			require a named human reviewer who can be appealed to and answers by name.
		</p>
	</section>

	<Section wide label="The ordinance and the script">
		<div class="ae-pillar-grid">
			<Card class="ae-script-card">
				<p class="ae-script-kicker">The two-minute council script · 10–20 min prep</p>
				<blockquote class="ae-script">
					&ldquo;My name is _______. I live on _______. Our city runs cameras
					that flag cars, and software that flags people. I am not asking you to
					remove them. I am asking that when one of them makes a call about a
					resident, a named person at the city reviews it and can be asked why.
					One clause. I'll leave the draft with the clerk.&rdquo;
				</blockquote>
				<div class="ae-script-foot">
					<Button href="/toolkit/council-script" variant="secondary" size="sm">Print the script</Button>
					<span class="ae-script-note">Meant to be read aloud, then handed over.</span>
				</div>
			</Card>

			<div class="ae-pillar-side">
				<Callout tone="warn" title="Drafted, not lawyered.">
					The model ordinance was drafted by this project and is
					<strong>not legal advice</strong>. It will not be presented as such
					until an actual attorney has reviewed it. If you are that attorney,
					this is the single highest-leverage hour on this site.
					<a href="/toolkit/ordinance">Claim the review &rarr;</a>
				</Callout>
				<Callout tone="sun">
					<p class="ae-where-kicker">Where this is already working</p>
					<ul>
						<li>
							50+ communities have canceled or paused camera contracts.
							<a href="https://www.npr.org/2026/02/17/nx-s1-5612825/flock-contracts-canceled-immigration-survillance-concerns">Tracked list</a>
						</li>
						<li>
							Montana requires human review of AI-driven agency decisions.
							<a href="https://www.ncsl.org/technology-and-communication/artificial-intelligence-2025-legislation">NCSL</a>
						</li>
					</ul>
				</Callout>
			</div>
		</div>
	</Section>

	<Stitch />

	<Section wide label="Become the lead for your town">
		<div class="ae-pillar-close">
			<Signature name="A person, by name.">
				Becoming a local lead means your name is on your town's page and you
				answer for it.
			</Signature>
			<Button href="/act#lead">Become the lead for your town</Button>
		</div>
	</Section>
</Page>

<style>
	.ae-pillar-hero {
		max-width: var(--ae-max-page);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: clamp(3rem, 2rem + 4vw, 4.5rem) var(--ae-gutter) 0;
	}

	.ae-pillar-h1 {
		margin: 0;
		font-size: var(--ae-fs-h1);
		line-height: 1.02;
		letter-spacing: -0.015em;
		max-width: 16ch;
	}

	.ae-pillar-h1-accent {
		color: var(--ae-cobalt);
	}

	.ae-pillar-lede {
		max-width: 62ch;
	}

	.ae-pillar-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;
		gap: 26px;
		align-items: start;
		max-width: 1100px;
	}

	.ae-pillar-side {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.ae-script-card {
		padding: 30px 32px;
	}

	.ae-script-kicker {
		margin: 0 0 12px;
		font-family: var(--ae-sans);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.656rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--ae-cobalt);
		max-width: 32ch;
	}

	/* Set in the display face and italic: this is meant to be spoken, and it
	   should not look like the surrounding argument. */
	.ae-script {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--ae-display);
		font-size: 1.06rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		font-style: italic;
	}

	.ae-script-foot {
		display: flex;
		gap: 12px;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		margin-top: 18px;
	}

	.ae-script-note {
		font-size: var(--ae-fs-meta);
		color: var(--ae-muted);
	}

	.ae-where-kicker {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
		font-family: var(--ae-sans);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-size: 0.656rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.ae-pillar-close {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 24px;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}

	@media (max-width: 860px) {
		.ae-pillar-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
	}
</style>
